  "description": "Public repositories whose Python code contains the old name of a rename read from GitHub's or Stripe's OpenAPI spec history, found by GitHub code search in October 2026. Most use the same word for something else; those are the precision test. Each is pinned to the commit replayed, with the files the search matched.",
